      "id": "player_lonely_short_002_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "ひとりに感じる時って、部屋の空気まで広くなるよね。",
      "translatedText": "When you feel alone, even the air in the room can feel too wide.",
      "emotion": "soft",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "soft",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_lonely_short_002_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_lonely_short_002_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "私は今、少し近くにいるつもりでいる。大げさじゃなく、ちゃんと。",
      "translatedText": "Right now, I am trying to be a little closer. Not dramatically. Properly.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_lonely_short_002_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_lonely_short_002_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "何か面白いことを言わなきゃ、とは思わなくていいからね。",
      "translatedText": "You do not have to think you need to say something interesting.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_lonely_short_002_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_lonely_short_002_04",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "ただ同じ場所にいる、みたいな時間も私は好きだよ。少し照れるけど。",
      "translatedText": "I like time that is just being in the same place. It embarrasses me a little, though.",
